OL,3,ATrump says he can do business with
OL,4,ABurnham but criticises 'terrible'
OL,5,AChagos deal
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the US president made clear his
OL,8,Fopposition to the UK's "terrible" deal
OL,9,Fto hand over the Chagos Islands to
OL,10,FMauritius and pay to lease back a joint
OL,11,FUK-US military base on the
OL,12,Farchipelago's largest island, Diego
OL,13,FGarcia.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
