OL,3,APlot targeting Manchester's Jewish
OL,4,Acommunity disrupted, say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested over a
OL,7,Fsuspected terrorist plot to target the
OL,8,FJewish community in Manchester, police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FThe men, both in their 30s, were
OL,12,Farrested on Sunday on the eve of Yom
OL,13,FKippur - considered to be the holiest
OL,14,Fday in the Jewish calendar - when
OL,15,Fthousands of British Jews were in
OL,16,Fsynagogues already guarded with a heavy
OL,17,Fsecurity and police presence.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
