OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS to build two military bases in
OL,4,AGreenland under new deal with Denmark
OL,5,
OL,6,FDanish PM Mette Frederiksen said the
OL,7,Fdeal was "good for the US, Denmark and
OL,8,FGreenland" and also for Europe and
OL,9,FNato, while Greenland's PM
OL,10,FJens-Frederik Nielsen said it was a
OL,11,F"win-win-win".
OL,13,FThe three leaders then inked the deal,
OL,14,Fseemingly ending more than a year of
OL,15,Ftension over the Arctic territory.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
